          "type": "input",
          "title": "You'll want to know: عنكبوت",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "عنكبوت — ʿankabūt — \"a spider\"."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "عنكبوت (ʿankabūt) is built on the native Arabic root ʿ-n-k-b, \"a spider\" (Lane). Lane lists this four-letter word; Hebrew ʿakkāvīsh, \"spider\", is usually compared."
            }
          ]
        },
